107 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 94 0 R
/E (SafeSense is an Arduino-based safety system that detects earthquakes and fire risks in real time using vibration and temperature sensors. It constantly monitors the environment and immediately shows clear alerts on a display, telling users what danger is happening and what actions to take. If both hazards occur at the same time, it triggers a higher-level emergency warning, helping users respond quickly and stay safe in critical situations.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
